---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Emails | Autoresponder from",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  The From line of every email: "Business Name <verified sender>". See emails/sender.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  function sender = 'emails/sender'
  assign from = ''
  if sender.ok
    assign from = sender.name | append: ' < ' | append: sender.email | append: ' >' | strip
  endif
-%}
{{ from }}
